OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few early showers in
OL,6,Fnortheast, otherwise a chilly start
OL,7,Fwith sunny spells. High cloud
OL,8,Fincreasing through the afternoon, with
OL,9,Fsome light rain reaching western
OL,10,FAberdeenshire towards evening.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry start in east,
OL,13,Fotherwise cloudy with occasional rain,
OL,14,Fwith some heavier outbreaks developing
OL,15,Fovernight, turning showery towards
OL,16,Fmorning. Fresh southerly winds along
OL,17,Fthe east coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
