OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FBright or sunny intervals and
OL,6,Fa few showers, these showers more so
OL,7,Fover Moray, with the best of the
OL,8,Fsunshine towards Aberdeen and the east.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FSunny
OL,11,Fintervals and some heavy showers on
OL,12,FSaturday, breezy. Mainly dry and
OL,13,Fbright Sunday, winds easing. Monday
OL,14,Fclouding over with some patchy rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
